# Curated library/ ships via copyStatic (only manifest-listed files, ~33MB).
# Block public/library/ (the un-trimmed mirror, 75MB) from being re-shipped
# by Vite's copyPublicDir. The 4 un-curated style-* dirs in public/ are
# still stripped by the closeBundle hook in vite.config.js.
public/library/
# Audio loops and the coltrane track ship with the deploy. The engine's
# SONGS array references them at boot (engine.html ~line 5741) for the
# "Try a built-in track" UX. Total ~3 MB — well worth not breaking boot.
# If we ever decide to defer audio to "on-demand via file picker only",
# update engine.html's SONGS array in the same commit.
# (Removed the `library/audio/` line that previously excluded them.)